<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 5</span>: </span><span id="S3.F5.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative comparison on Subject fidelity refinement on the FidelityBench-258K dataset.<span id="S3.F5.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The insets in the full images show the reference subject images and the red and green boxes indicate the zoomed-in regions. The regions for zoomed-in views are found on the SDG baseline images and cropped the same area for all methods.</span></span></figcaption>
